Based on Forgotten Dungeon MUD version 4.83.46.

Forgotten Dungeon: Sergey Kulik (Saboteur), Taras Phizer (Adron), and the
contributors credited in mud/license.fd and the original in-game credits.
DikuMUD, Merc, and ROM retain their original notices and noncommercial terms
in mud/license.doc, mud/license.txt, and mud/license.rom.

The browser client and WebSocket proxy are based on maldorne/mud-web-client
and maldorne/mud-web-proxy. Both are GPL-3.0-or-later; pinned source revisions,
patches, and build instructions are in web/README.md. Their license texts are
retained in the images and served by the browser client.

This revival is operated noncommercially for a private group of friends.
Original game passwords remain plaintext in player saves; use a unique game
password. Character passwords are required by the game; the website is public.
